% SCAFFOLDING stand-in for SIMPOS's class `multi_column_menu`, compiled by
% psi/espc.py into the package `simpos`.  It is NOT SIMPOS: the class is
% lost (docs/simpos/subsystems/window.md §0.3, §1.6, the single-select
% menus).  TM-125 p8 (4.1) lists it as a stand-alone class: "the class
% for making the single select multi column menu".  MENDELS (IFS No.61),
% 2026-11-27: the title bar of its method editor (med_win.esp:4-17, made
% with nature([with_superior_input_buffer, with_shared_window]), which
% basic_window.esp does not act on).
%
% THE NATURE LIST IS INFERENCE: that of
% multi_column_menu_with_superior_input_buffer.esp (whose head has the
% sources) without with_superior_input_buffer, which the name leaves
% out.  It has no method of its own.

class multi_column_menu has

nature
        labeled_sash,
        as_menu,
        as_multiple_column,
        as_single_select,
        as_mouse_input,
        inferior_window;

end.
